{
	"name": "Charismatic Commander",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/environment/people/commoner.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Also at 13th level, you gain an additional number of inexperienced followers equal to your proficiency bonus.</p><p>As a bonus action, you may form your followers into a defensive body that is at your command. While in this formation, your followers have the statistics of a @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-monsters.Actor.ef7tpqwh6mbh1yat]{Guard Squad}. The squad acts on your initiative, and you may issue commands to move or attack as a free action. If no command is issued, the guard squad instead takes the Dodge action. When the squad is reduced to 0 hit points, your followers do not die but disband and retreat and cannot be rallied again until you complete a long rest.</p>",
